{"id":"b5719f983c5219c1","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PresUC.md","title":"PresUC","display":"PresUC","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PresUC","parameters":["a","b"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PresUC"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>a</span><span>b</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PresUC a b)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists E\n  (exists F (exists R (exists f (exists r (and (@ PresSig E F R f r) (@ FClosure E F R f r a b)))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a8b1332dd97b2603\" href=\"?note=a8b1332dd97b2603\" title=\"ZFC_FClosure\">FClosure</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8f6aad59a20ce501\" href=\"?note=8f6aad59a20ce501\" title=\"ZFC_PresSig\">PresSig</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PresUC a b)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FClosure","status":"resolved","id":"a8b1332dd97b2603","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FClosure|FClosure]]；[[ZFC_PresSig|PresSig]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PresSig","status":"resolved","id":"8f6aad59a20ce501","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FClosure|FClosure]]；[[ZFC_PresSig|PresSig]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":835,"backlinks":[{"id":"ed8ec2c6db773694","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PresUC|PresUC]]"},{"id":"64c8defddc97b09a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_PresBaseRaw|PresBaseRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresCongruenceRaw|PresCongruenceRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresInductionRaw|PresInductionRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresUC|PresUC]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-622","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_PresUC|PresUC]]"},{"id":"92fe17dd954e2634","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PresUC|PresUC]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","a8b1332dd97b2603","8f6aad59a20ce501","593f9bdab4d60707"]}